OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to help families who've
OL,4,Alost their babies'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old girl has spoken of how
OL,7,Fshe wants to make "a massive difference
OL,8,Ffor people who've lost their babies".
OL,10,FDaisy, from Edgmond in Shropshire,
OL,11,Fcycled 25 miles to Stafford to raise
OL,12,Fnearly #2,000 for local maternity
OL,13,Fservices.
OL,15,FShe set up the ride after her sisters,
OL,16,Ftwins Aurora and Seren died after
OL,17,Fpregnancy complications, in January
OL,18,F2023, and her family got support from
OL,19,FShrewsbury and Telford Hospitals NHS
OL,20,FTrust's maternity bereavement team.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
